"open":{"price":"Not closed. The note says AKN resale averages stand as quoted by racin.mk, but racin names no source for them. After the patches, the Karpoš / Aerodrom row still says '(AKN, reported Aug 2026)' and the sources footer still says 'racin.mk, 31 Aug 2026, citing AKN data'; both need the same relabel as the corrected Centar cell, or AKN's own report as the source. kvadrat.house, an aggregator using Cadastre data, shows Centar at 119,089 MKD/m² on 93 transactions, so it does not reproduce 119,914. The rest holds: NBRSM's Q3 2026 +10.3% and +1.3% are confirmed, and the pending usable-area objection is answered by patch 1. Line 4's pages support it, though the saved Reklama5 copies are not readable "}}
